><surname>Wong</surname> <given-names>IO</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Tong</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Wong</surname> <given-names>TW</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>A clinical prediction rule for diagnosing severe acute respiratory syndrome in the emergency department.</article-title><source>Ann Intern Med</source> <year>2004</year>;<volume>141</volume>:<fpage>333</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>42</lpage> <comment>Epub 2004 Aug 23</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15326019</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R10"><label>10. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Naylor</surname> <given-names>CD</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Chantler</surname> <given-names>C</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Griffiths</surname> <given-names>S</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Learning from SARS in Hong Kong and Toronto.</article-title><source>JAMA</source> <year>2004</year>;<volume>291</volume>:<fpage>2483</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>7</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.291.20.2483</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15161900</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>